      ],
      "text": "1. Introduction",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.244384765625,
        204.24803161621094,
        212.0393829345703
      ],
      "text": "1.1 Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.4904327392578,
        527.446533203125,
        231.9334259033203
      ],
      "text": "Tuberculosis (TB) is a leading cause of death from a single infectious agent, despite being largely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.69032287597656,
        527.5662231445312,
        245.13331604003906
      ],
      "text": "curable and preventable. In 2019, an estimated 2.9 million of the 10 million people who fell ill with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996950149536133,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.0963897705078,
        527.4382934570312,
        258.3334045410156
      ],
      "text": "(1) were not diagnosed or reported to the World Health Organization (WHO) . WHO’s End TB Strategy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.978879928588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        254.2963409423828,
        527.4197998046875,
        271.5333557128906
      ],
      "text": "(2, 3) envisions a 90% reduction in TB incidence and a 95% reduction in TB deaths by 2035  , and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.290283203125,
        527.4100952148438,
        284.7333068847656
      ],
      "text": "Declaration adopted by the United Nations General Assembly in September 2018 at the High-Level",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.49041748046875,
        527.4344482421875,
        297.9334411621094
      ],
      "text": "Meeting on the Fight Against Tuberculosis commits to diagnosing and treating 40 million people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.89630126953125,
        527.3834228515625,
        311.1333312988281
      ],
      "text": "(4) with TB by 2022  . In order to achieve these ambitious targets, there is an urgent need to deploy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.890380859375,
        527.6036987304688,
        324.3334045410156
      ],
      "text": "strategies to improve the diagnosis and initiation of care for people with TB. One key strategy is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.0903015136719,
        527.4445190429688,
        337.5333251953125
      ],
      "text": "systematic screening for TB disease, which is included in the End TB Strategy as a central component",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.2903137207031,
        365.525390625,
        350.73333740234375
      ],
      "text": "of its first pillar, aimed at ensuring early diagnosis for all with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        357.9942932128906,
        527.5767822265625,
        372.43731689453125
      ],
      "text": "To help facilitate the implementation of TB screening at the country level, WHO published guidelines on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.944962501525879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.40032958984375,
        527.4967041015625,
        385.6373291015625
      ],
      "text": "(5). systematic screening for TB in 2013   Since then, there have been important new studies evaluating",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.983687400817871,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.3943176269531,
        527.5633544921875,
        398.83734130859375
      ],
      "text": "the impact of screening interventions on both individual-level and community-level outcomes related",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977577209472656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.59429931640625,
        527.17822265625,
        412.0373229980469
      ],
      "text": "to TB, as well as new research evaluating innovative tools for screening for TB among important",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.7943115234375,
        527.4069213867188,
        425.2373352050781
      ],
      "text": "populations at high risk for TB disease. In light of these new developments and continual requests by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.9942932128906,
        527.4136352539062,
        438.43731689453125
      ],
      "text": "Member States for guidance on how to conduct effective TB screening, in 2020 WHO convened a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.1943054199219,
        527.4343872070312,
        451.6373291015625
      ],
      "text": "Guideline Development Group (GDG) to examine the evidence in order to update WHO’s guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.3943176269531,
        306.48968505859375,
        464.83734130859375
      ],
      "text": "and recommendations for screening for TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.82550048828125,
        526.6019287109375,
        503.6205139160156
      ],
      "text": "1.2 Definition and objectives of systematic screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.62548828125,
        190.39891052246094,
        526.4204711914062
      ],
      "text": "for TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.6075439453125,
        527.438720703125,
        546.3145141601562
      ],
      "text": "the systematic  For the purpose of this guideline, systematic screening for TB disease is defined as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.8074340820312,
        527.5757446289062,
        559.31640625
      ],
      "text": "identification of people at risk for TB disease, in a predetermined target group, by assessing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.0073852539062,
        527.4204711914062,
        572.71435546875
      ],
      "text": "symptoms and using tests, examinations or other procedures that can be applied rapidly .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.99779987335205,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.471435546875,
        527.433349609375,
        585.9144287109375
      ],
      "text": "The screening tests, examinations and other procedures should efficiently distinguish people with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.67138671875,
        527.4058837890625,
        599.1143798828125
      ],
      "text": "high probability of having TB disease from those who are unlikely to have TB disease. Among those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.8715209960938,
        527.4346313476562,
        612.3145141601562
      ],
      "text": "whose screening is positive, the diagnosis needs to be established by diagnostic evaluation, consisting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972967147827148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.071533203125,
        491.5235900878906,
        625.5145263671875
      ],
      "text": "of one or more diagnostic tests, and clinical assessment, which together have high accuracy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.775390625,
        527.4024047851562,
        647.2183837890625
      ],
      "text": "Systematic screening for TB disease is predominantly provider initiated. It may be conducted among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.9754028320312,
        527.4542846679688,
        660.4183959960938
      ],
      "text": "people who do not seek health care because they do not have or recognize symptoms, they do",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        659.17529296875,
        527.4475708007812,
        673.6182861328125
      ],
      "text": "not perceive that they have a health problem that warrants medical attention, there are barriers to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.3754272460938,
        527.3881225585938,
        686.8184204101562
      ],
      "text": "accessing care, or for other reasons. It may also target people seeking health care who do or do not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.575439453125,
        527.3751220703125,
        700.0184326171875
      ],
      "text": "have symptoms or signs compatible with TB and who may not be identified by passive case-finding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.775390625,
        527.1943359375,
        713.2183837890625
      ],
      "text": "as possibly having TB. People seeking care who may be eligible for TB screening include people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.9754028320312,
        527.3970947265625,
        726.4183959960938
      ],
      "text": "with medical conditions that constitute risk factors for TB (such as people living with HIV or diabetes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.17529296875,
        476.54638671875,
        739.6182861328125
      ],
      "text": "mellitus) who may be seeking care for reasons other than symptoms compatible with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        475.78839111328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        551.980712890625,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "1. Introduction 5",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}